# Changelog

All notable changes to **Theme Fetcher** will be documented in this file.

---

## [v25] - 2026-11-24

### 🚀 Highlights & Major Improvements
- **Strict Series Root-Folder Scanner:** Reworked recursive folder scanner to strictly identify television show roots. Ignores individual episode files (`.mkv`, `.mp4`), season folders (`Staffel 1`, `Season 02`), and disc subdirectories.
- **Image & Fanart Exclusion:** Prevents directories containing only images (`poster.jpg`, `fanart.jpg`, `extrafanart/`) or metadata from registering as standalone media entries.
- **Clean Production Codebase:** Streamlined server architecture and removed deprecated debug hooks for enhanced container performance.

### 🐛 Fixed
- Fixed duplicated entries for television series caused by recursive filesystem traversing.
- Resolved Jellyfin type mapping to strictly accept `Movie`, `Series`, and `BoxSet`.

---

## [v24] - 2026-11-21

### ✨ Added
- **Integrated Web Audio Player:** In-browser audio streaming directly from search results with real-time scrub/seek slider, play/pause toggles, and track duration counters.
- **Mid-Track Seek (`⏩ Mid`):** Instant jump button (50% track duration) to quickly check whether a candidate contains the actual theme hook or dialogue intro.
- **Soundtrack Identification Engine:** Cross-references media titles against MusicBrainz and Wikidata to detect official scores and composers before executing audio queries.
- **HTML Badge Status Fix:** Rendered status badges natively (`✓ Present` in emerald green, `✕ Missing` in red) replacing legacy raw strings.

---

## [v23] - 2026-11-20

### ✨ Added
- **Bilingual Interface:** Full dynamic language toggle between German (🇩🇪 DE) and English (🇬🇧 EN) across all UI elements, settings, and status messages.
- **Dark Mode UI Overhaul:** Rebuilt frontend layout with slate/graphite theme (`#121417`), responsive grid layouts, and modal windows.
- **Real-Time Row Progress Indicators:** Individual progress bars per row displaying active steps (`Searching`, `Downloading`, `Mastering`).

---

## [v20] - 2026-11-18

### ✨ Added
- **Plex Media Server Integration:** Full support for Plex libraries, authentication tokens (`X-Plex-Token`), and collection synchronization.
- **Multi-Disk Path Resolver:** Automatic cross-mount translation between host paths and container mount points (`/media`, multi-disk UUID paths).
- **Audio Mastering Pipeline:** Automated ffmpeg audio normalizer applying 1.5s fade-in and 3.0s fade-out curves for seamless background playback in media centers.

---

## [v1.0] - 2026-11-15

### 🌟 Initial Release
- **Jellyfin API Support:** Automated library fetching for movies, series, and box sets via Jellyfin REST API.
- **Audio Retrieval:** Autonomous soundtrack search and extraction using `yt-dlp` and `ffmpeg`.
- **Dockerized Architecture:** Containerized deployment with persistent state, configuration management, and web dashboard.
